<p><strong>Closure of Positives:</strong></p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Closure of positives Inverse)</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If 0&lt;x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span><strong> then </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt; 1/x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Closure of Non-Negatives Under Inverse)</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If 0 leq x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0 leq x^(-1)&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.87em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.51em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Inequality Multiplication)</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x &lt; y, p leq q, 0&lt;x, 0&lt;y,0&lt;p,0&lt;q&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit">p</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">p</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text">and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x*p&lt;y*q&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit">p</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span class="ML__cmr">&sdot;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Third-of-a-Pound Burger)</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x &lt; y, 0&lt;x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;1/y &lt; 1/x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.63em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Positive Exponentiation)</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;<span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If 0&lt;x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt;x^y&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__msubsup"><span class="ML__vlist-t"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.72em;"><span style="top: -3.41em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">y</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Positive Factorial)</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt;x!&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:"><strong>Theorem(Positive Fraction)</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If 0&lt;p, 0&lt;q&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">p</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;0&lt;p/q&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.02em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.63em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.58em;"><span style="height: 0.63em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">p</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;Declare rational, irrational, e&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">Declare rational, irrational, </span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text">and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">e</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
<h1><strong>Basic Definitions:&nbsp;</strong></h1>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Def of Integer</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If p in NN, q in NN&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">p</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">N</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">N</span></span></span></span></span> then<strong> </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;p-q in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">p</span><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">q</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Def of Rational</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x is rational&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text"> is rational</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x=m/n, 1 leq n for some m, n in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 0.94em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">n</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.44em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit">m</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__text"> for some </span><span class="ML__mathit">m</span><span class="ML__cmr">,</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Def of Irrational</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x is irrational equiv x is not rational&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text"> is irrational</span><span class="ML__cmr">&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__cmr">&equiv;&nbsp;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text"> is not rational</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Def of e</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;e=sum k=0 to infinity of 1/k!&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">e</span><span class="ML__cmr">=</span><span class="ML__op-group"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.66em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -1.84em;"><span style="height: 0.49em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">=0</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.05em;"><span style="height: 1.61em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__op-symbol ML__large-op">&sum;</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -4.3em;"><span style="height: 0.31em; display: inline-block; font-size: 70%;"><span class="ML__cmr">&infin;</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__mfrac"><span class="ML__vlist-t ML__vlist-t2"><span class="ML__vlist-r"><span class="ML__vlist" style="height: 1.15em;"><span class="ML__center" style="top: -2.31em;"><span style="height: 0.7em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__mathit" style="margin-right: 0.04em;">k</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span></span></span><span class="ML__center" style="top: -3.5em;"><span style="height: 0.65em; display: inline-block;"><span class="ML__cmr">1</span></span></span></span><span class="ML__vlist-s">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> &nbsp;</p>
</div>
<h1><strong>Closure:</strong></h1>
<p>The following lemmas all trivially follow from closure by induction</p>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Closure of Negation on </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expositorymath&quot;" data-metadata_latex="&quot;\\mathbb{Z}&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>)</p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span><strong> </strong>then<strong> </strong><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;-x in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__cmr">&minus;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span><strong> &nbsp;</strong></p>
</div>
<h1><strong>Assumed Lemmas:&nbsp;</strong></h1>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (Natural Factorial)</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If x in ZZ, 0 leq x&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text"> and </span></span><span class="ML__cmr">0</span><span class="ML__cmr">&le;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x! in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">!</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span></p>
</div>
<div class="lurch-atom" data-metadata_type="&quot;rule&quot;" data-shell_title="Rule:">
<p><strong>Theorem (No Integer Between Consecutive Integers)</strong></p>
<p><span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;If n&lt;x, x&lt;n+1, n in ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__text">If </span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&lt;</span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">+</span><span class="ML__cmr">1</span><span class="ML__text">, </span><span style="color: #000000;"><span class="ML__text">and </span></span><span class="ML__mathit">n</span><span class="ML__cmr">&isin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span> then <span class="lurch-atom" contenteditable="false" data-metadata_type="&quot;expression&quot;" data-metadata_lurch-notation="&quot;x notin ZZ&quot;"><span class="lurch-atom-body"><span class="ML__latex"><span class="ML__base"><span class="ML__mathit">x</span><span class="ML__cmr">&notin;</span><span class="ML__bb">Z</span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p></div>
        